    },
    "body": "I see \"defined_by\" is a property of an extension. Should we make it a property of an extension version instead? This would allow an early version of an extension to be named in UDB and later be accepted as an official extension name in the ISA manual. That would be the ideal flow. Namely that we define extensions in UDB where they are missing in the ISA manuals and then hopefully they get added to the ISA manual.",
